## Quick Start

1. Read `MIGRATION_GUIDE.md` for the full procedure.
2. Configure variables: copy `terraform/terraform.tfvars.example` to
   `terraform.tfvars` and fill in values.
3. Apply: `cd terraform/ && terraform init && terraform plan -out=tfplan &&
   terraform apply tfplan && terraform output > ../terraform-outputs.txt`.
{{IF has_postgres}}4. Migrate PostgreSQL: `./scripts/migrate-postgres.sh`.{{ENDIF}}
{{IF has_redis}}5. Migrate Redis: `./scripts/migrate-redis.sh`.{{ENDIF}}
6. Deploy the app (build/push image, update ECS) — see MIGRATION_GUIDE Phase 3.
7. Verify + cutover — MIGRATION_GUIDE Phases 4–5.

